# No subtitles / subtext

Do **not** add secondary copy under titles, section headings, or panel names.

Forbidden patterns include:
- Subtitles / subtext / helper lines under an `h1` / `h2` / section title
- Lead paragraphs like “Contact and pickup address — reused on…”
- Explanatory one-liners under “Personal details”, “Preferences”, etc.
- Marketing-style supporting sentences that only restate the heading

Use the heading alone. Put needed explanation inside the control, note box, empty state, or field label — not as a subtitle under the title.
